    "claim_first_party",
    "adopt_kernel_outcome",
    "adopt_verified_work_product"
  ],
  "honestNativeGap": "Layer 1 only prepares and consumes bounded, normalized recording, fixture, loopback, or BLOCKED_ENV RDS responses. It never resolves native credentials, calls AWS RDS, claims Connected/native/first-party evidence, stores endpoint credentials or raw provider text, issues database effects, creates a durable provider receipt, performs independent native read-back, or adopts a Mission Work Product."
